        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/e22f127054524d3d3fadd6e478e7a78f.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/e22f127054524d3d3fadd6e478e7a78f.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy Maiden Wars</strong> is a classic tactical RPG with a diverse cast of iconic Touhou Project heroines. Explore the expansive world of Gensokyo, a fantastical realm where humans, yokai, and gods exist side-by-side. Seek out the source of supernational incidents disturbing the peace across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/1228abf604b823aaf3ed2733c64ea83b.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/1228abf604b823aaf3ed2733c64ea83b.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your units across grid-based maps, take down enemies with strategic positioning and turn-based tactics, and clear stages to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and a full-featured tutorial system make this a perfect entry point for players new to the genre—while offering plenty of depth for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/9bc40c2597f3dc4f2ee17b5b041d5e37.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/9bc40c2597f3dc4f2ee17b5b041d5e37.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/fe25ec95e6830e2c2cedd1ae76a38511.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/fe25ec95e6830e2c2cedd1ae76a38511.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in beautifully animated battles whenever characters clash. From sword slashes and gunfire to devastating Spell Card finishers, every attack is brought to life with flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your favorite characters unleash flashy moves in the rich, vibrant world of Gensokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/bf955bfe6f2e7913ca0e913c524f5b5e.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/bf955bfe6f2e7913ca0e913c524f5b5e.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/82825f2131a0ab713c5c915a6ef389b3.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/82825f2131a0ab713c5c915a6ef389b3.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your squad between missions in the <strong>Intermission</strong> screen—equip gear, assign skills, and build the dream team your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique traits and signature abilities, opening the door to countless team compositions and strategies. Go all-in on your favorites or hunt down the most broken combos—how you play is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/c2deb2dc79095f4eafe5e8350a1174f2.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/c2deb2dc79095f4eafe5e8350a1174f2.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/a705a418193fbb1351d8fc4df312d452.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/a705a418193fbb1351d8fc4df312d452.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between shrine maiden <strong>Reimu Hakurei</strong> or magician <strong>Marisa Kirisame</strong> as your protagonist—your choice will impact parts of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game weaves together reinterpretations of storylines from across the <i>Touhou Project</i> series, uniting them into a single, epic narrative arc for both newcomers and longtime fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/ca33e633ff0d8823f04e70a94e4097e7.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/ca33e633ff0d8823f04e70a94e4097e7.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/5242661529c23c62a25d056eb780d6d7.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/5242661529c23c62a25d056eb780d6d7.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the gameplay, enjoy a rich selection of bonus content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed <strong>character and terminology encyclopedia</strong> that introduces the world of Touhou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive <strong>music room</strong> with over 200 tracks from the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for both Touhou veterans and those just beginning their journey into Gensokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/d042b3e788e5522d3348e24e48bbe927.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/d042b3e788e5522d3348e24e48bbe927.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/e22f127054524d3d3fadd6e478e7a78f.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/e22f127054524d3d3fadd6e478e7a78f.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy Maiden Wars</strong> is a classic tactical RPG with a diverse cast of iconic Touhou Project heroines. Explore the expansive world of Gensokyo, a fantastical realm where humans, yokai, and gods exist side-by-side. Seek out the source of supernational incidents disturbing the peace across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/1228abf604b823aaf3ed2733c64ea83b.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/1228abf604b823aaf3ed2733c64ea83b.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your units across grid-based maps, take down enemies with strategic positioning and turn-based tactics, and clear stages to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and a full-featured tutorial system make this a perfect entry point for players new to the genre—while offering plenty of depth for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/9bc40c2597f3dc4f2ee17b5b041d5e37.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/9bc40c2597f3dc4f2ee17b5b041d5e37.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\