vif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the gameplay, enjoy a rich selection of bonus content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed <strong>character and terminology encyclopedia</strong> that introduces the world of Touhou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive <strong>music room</strong> with over 200 tracks from the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for both Touhou veterans and those just beginning their journey into Gensokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras/d042b3e788e5522d3348e24e48bbe927.avif?t=1761286177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575980/extras_big/d042b3e788e5522d3348e24e48bbe927.avif?t=1761286177 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
